Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN will take the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Itaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you will come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For FB... FB... FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll kill you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make her pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,CRT.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if it fails...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leap!
