Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri was still in elementary school
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}when her grandmother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She went to her grave every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even six months after her grandmother's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She always had her grandmother's \Npocket watch in her hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and she was always, always looking up at the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...like she was waiting for \Nher grandmother to come and get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then one day, there was a ray of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was the kind called Rembrandt lighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...or an angel's ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It felt like the light was drawing her up...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...like she was going to disappear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let it take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be my hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use you for human experimentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The words that came out of my mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}were from some show I'd seen as a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri and I had watched it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some mad scientist, screaming like an idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mayushii is your hostage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I can't go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you napping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost five.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going shopping, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll order pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't get the tropical special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The time leap worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mayuri? Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii said she was going to Miss Luka's \Nto invite her to the party, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The development conference is canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, go home now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,His phone starts ringing, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't answer the phone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to leave a message—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing to indicate \Nthat the worldline changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's different from a D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really am back at 5:00 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bullet train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the bullet train is white.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After this, Mayuri will return with Suzuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I go to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, who would believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I've come from the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Three hours left...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oka... No, Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-She already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thirty minutes ago, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was going back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't she get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so nice of you to \Ninvite me to the party, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she say she was stopping anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see her, tell her to call me right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the worldline hasn't changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I don't do anything differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she should do what she did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyan-nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris can't answer the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need something—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that we were done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You time leaped from the future, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The second you answered the phone, \Nyou seemed to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,From the way you're acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guess that something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...but I don't have time to give you the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Run? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get away from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Tell Daru too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Ochanomizu—{that's a neighborhood name}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She just invited me to your party—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn right, up there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which way is Ochanomizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take Nae shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask at the police substation{box}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you've taken her, don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's the first star!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was canceled. I told Kurisu and Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I asked Suzu to come too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and Daru was ordering pizza...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii doesn't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You always do things I don't understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but today, I really don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really want to \Ndo the experiment, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But just for now, can you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain the details later. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Mayushii just got scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rush hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one's on the platform...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the following lines have been shut down due to a bomb threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they don't know when \Nthe trains will start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, get to the subway now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri was the one who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Okabe Rintaro has been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1809)}Mayuri, I will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I got word
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,that Mr. Braun is planning to return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, did you do something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:15:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was I too forceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It doesn't matter if I was acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For now, I just need them away from the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.65,0:15:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't answer the phone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is it taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's going to end up like last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to find Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.16,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\frz20.104\fs75\blur3\b1\bord0\pos(1147.5,699)}Lukako
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako! It's me! Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oka... I'm sorry, Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Mayuri there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just heading bac—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell her not to move until I get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was going back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:16:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.49,0:16:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bullet train!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the bullet train is white.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to go fix Fubuki's costume
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and then go to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fubuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A cosplay friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She said a thread on the costume \NI made came undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got a message from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it's fixed, I'll go right to the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll make it to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. The party...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The party was cancel—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't use the lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{It can't be helped.}...due to unforeseen consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wanted you to come with me for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:16:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Fubuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but save it for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're going away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,On a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can put Fubuki off until tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is very sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time to catch the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii isn't ready at all, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.32,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Akihabara Station that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking the subway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a really long time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,since you dragged me along like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.41,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fs51\frx14\fry8\frz12.5\pos(877.5,129)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.41,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fs42\frz12.44\frx13\fry0\pos(894,168)\fax.1}Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.41,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\frx4\fry6\frz12.46\pos(484.5,471)\fax.075}Tell me later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch isn't working...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sobu line shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A bomb threat was called in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii has a lot of questions she wants to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's okay for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.89,0:20:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,when this is over, \NI want you to tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have that party sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.53,0:21:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to surprise her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:21:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, I {\i1}will{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...save you!
